# Balanced opening lines for SPRT self-play.
#
# One line per opening, written as space-separated UCI moves played from the
# start position. Each opening is played twice per round with colors swapped,
# so the side to move at the end of a line does not matter.
#
# The referee validates every line at startup (and `cargo test` covers the
# embedded copy): any illegal move aborts the match with an error.

